      ],
      "ET_row_sha256": "20a46e79a2322e7cd02fedd8912859230ae34448043fb6b2a3f30ba23602f782"
    },
    {
      "table": 2,
      "row": 11,
      "cells": [
        "\tReason for change:",
        "For support of subsequent LTM, a second round LTM preparation procedure, namely LTM Configuration Update is introduced for the source gNB to send the common CSI resource configuration (the combination of CSI-RS resources from all candidate cells) to the candidate gNB. And the candidate gNB may also utilize this new procedure to return the CSI report configuration for L1 measurement encoded in the LTM Candidate Configuration IE.\n\nFurthermore, the candidate gNB may also use the LTM Configuration Update procedure to feedback the CSI Report Configuration for Early CSI Acquisition and CSI-IM measurement (the ltm-CSI-ReportConfig RRC IE).\n\nThe procedural text for providing CSI reporting configuration for CSI Acquisition and for CSI-IM measurement is missing.\n"
      ],
      "field": "reasonForChange",
      "ET_row_sha256": "ea602f455c24fae0e3f76ea2235ded2b884e3b59f4f1072cb27d115fd01d6b8c"
    },
    {
      "table": 2,
      "row": 13,
      "cells": [
        "\tSummary of change:",
        "To clarify in procedural text to allow the candidate gNB-DU to provide the CSI reporting configuration for CSI Acquisition and for CSI-IM measurement for the candidate cell based on the existing CSI resource configuration IE in the LTM CONFIGURATION UPDATE message.\n\nImpact Analysis:\nThis CR has an impact under functional point of view. \nThe impact can be considered isolated."
      ],
      "field": "summaryOfChange",
      "ET_row_sha256": "36c0e91c12a4baccbcaec781a15c5b2ef9b3894e99189999636a44736e1ea219"
    },
    {
      "table": 2,
      "row": 15,
      "cells": [
        "\tConsequences if not approved:",
        "Errors exist in the specification."
      ],
      "field": "consequencesIfNotApproved",
      "ET_row_sha256": "42be295557e5d1df64533045164d8779f7e1259fcb6bab9fb43b6505bea3d3ba"
    }
  ],
